        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Thrifted an old fur coat that needed some repairs and was recommended to come here. The owner took the time to explain the cost and value of the coat and repairs. They carry new and secondhand coats in great conditions. They have boots, gloves, hats, capes, purses, phone holders, pillows!! I should have bought my coat there to begin with😂 truly impressive",
