        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKt-F3YW_h1Pm5d92Ugn3dEdwdJzcGf32TxVatrjS47uYiA7ZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A warm and welcoming atmosphere in this fur shop! The owner was very friendly and provided exceptional service. He quickly found what I needed at a reasonable price and introduced me to other interesting products. A pleasant experience – I'll be back before and after the holidays! Thank you and see you next time 🙂",
        "time": 1734896284,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Danica Arseneault",
