        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent service! The used coat I bought is gorgeous, and so is my partner's hat! Beautiful shop with lots of choices and a super friendly atmosphere! I highly recommend it to everyone.",
        "time": 1740086834,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marc-Andre Caron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110070149270203330607/reviews",
