        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJDfla90h11Z7oknd-O3aRtIxPIjlq6mgqe_1E_xiPB7H0boQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I went to see if I could get some warm mittens. I had never been inside this building, I was pleasantly surprised! They made me custom mittens in beaver and sheepskin in 2 days at a very affordable price! My hands have never been cold again, I recommend them to everyone!!",
